; R-29 — WHAT JUST HAPPENED, in display type above the winner line.
;
; The intermission said only who won, never WHY, so a player who lost a round to the
; clock and a player who lost it to a tag saw the same card. This is the missing word:
; TAGGED / LATA DOWN / DENTED / TIME.
;
; ⚠️ NO SIGNAL CARRIES THE REASON — it is classified in the UI from public state; see
; `role_swap_card.gd::_classify_reason()` for how, and for what that cannot distinguish.
; Colour and outline are set there too, not here.
;
; Sits ABOVE ResultLabel and larger than it: the reason is the news, "TEAM A WINS THE
; ROUND" is the consequence. Costs no new tween beat, so the §4.6 timeline is untouched —
; nothing may race the world reset at 3.0s.
